        {
            "id": "f8b1393c-c48c-4b92-8305-358da5d94bab",
            "build_id": "04c52d99-c579-4513-b608-4cd4a444e265",
            "round_number": 1,
            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-09-17T03:17:03.54939+00:00",
            "notes": "If you know how to blink melee, [Flash Fist](item_418a92bd-1b45-4135-aca0-682d3c7a845b) is an extra free 10 damage to your blink melee. This can synergize with [Siphon Gloves](item_099f8177-c2a4-4e13-b321-99349f8b1eb7) so feel free to take that over armor if you're not playing into a Soldier/Reaper/Moira. This perk also synergizes with [Charged Plating](item_b8ca58e7-6ae2-40ee-8618-fe2f32315295), and will scale with the rest of the build.\n\nIf you aren't confident blink meleeing, or if the team is playing only hard to dive characters (e.g. Moira, Juno, Brig, Kiriko), you may find more value in [Auto Recall](item_ae3dbebf-c306-4408-b698-6f666ace0a7c) or [Quantum Clip](item_3a108115-ec6e-4b98-8074-1b015cf535f1) depending on your skill level.\n\nFor items, generally always take [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0).\n\nIf you went with [Flash Fist](item_418a92bd-1b45-4135-aca0-682d3c7a845b) then always go with [Charged Plating](item_b8ca58e7-6ae2-40ee-8618-fe2f32315295) and [Siphon Gloves](item_099f8177-c2a4-4e13-b321-99349f8b1eb7). I opt to use this over [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) since it will give you enough survivability and buff your blink-melee enough.\n\nIf you didn't take those, take [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6). If against poke (Freja, Ashe) take [Ballistic Buffer](item_40146dd3-a8cb-40ca-8917-c430bfa2be0e) otherwise take [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf).",
